<li id="mwAUc"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Crown_Prince_of_Saudi_Arabia" title="Crown Prince of Saudi Arabia" id="mwAUg">Crown Prince</a> <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mohammed_bin_Salman" title="Mohammed bin Salman" id="mwAUk">Mohammed bin Salman</a> (son of <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Salman_of_Saudi_Arabia" title="Salman of Saudi Arabia" id="mwAUo">King Salman</a>)</li>
<li id="mwAUs"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mishaal_bin_Majid_Al_Saud" title="Mishaal bin Majid Al Saud" id="mwAUw">Prince Mishaal bin Majid</a> (son of <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Majid_bin_Abdulaziz_Al_Saud" title="Majid bin Abdulaziz Al Saud" id="mwAU0">Prince Majid</a>)</li>
<li id="mwAU4"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Faisal_bin_Thamir?action=edit&amp;redlink=1" title="Faisal bin Thamir (page does not exist)" class="new" typeof="mw:LocalizedAttrs" id="mwAU8" data-mw-i18n='{"title":{"lang":"x-page","key":"red-link-title","params":["Faisal bin Thamir"]}}'>Prince Faisal bin Thamir</a> (son of <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Thamir_bin_Abdulaziz_Al_Saud" title="Thamir bin Abdulaziz Al Saud" id="mwAVA">Prince Thamir</a>)</li>
<li id="mwAVE"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nayef_bin_Mamdouh_Al_Saud" title="Nayef bin Mamdouh Al Saud" id="mwAVI">Prince Nayef bin Mamdouh</a> (son of <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mamdouh_bin_Abdulaziz_Al_Saud" title="Mamdouh bin Abdulaziz Al Saud" id="mwAVM">Prince Mamdouh</a>)</li>
<li id="mwAVQ"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Abdulaziz_bin_Sattam?action=edit&amp;redlink=1" title="Abdulaziz bin Sattam (page does not exist)" class="new" typeof="mw:LocalizedAttrs" id="mwAVU" data-mw-i18n='{"title":{"lang":"x-page","key":"red-link-title","params":["Abdulaziz bin Sattam"]}}'>Prince Abdulaziz bin Sattam</a> (son of <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sattam_bin_Abdulaziz_Al_Saud" title="Sattam bin Abdulaziz Al Saud" id="mwAVY">Prince Sattam</a>)</li>
<li id="mwAVc"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Abdulaziz_bin_Ahmed_Al_Saud" title="Abdulaziz bin Ahmed Al Saud" id="mwAVg">Prince Abdulaziz bin Ahmed</a> (son of <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ahmed_bin_Abdulaziz_Al_Saud" title="Ahmed bin Abdulaziz Al Saud" id="mwAVk">Prince Ahmed</a> who is still alive)<sup about="#mwt116" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-27" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-27"}}'><a href="#cite_note-27" id="mwAVo"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAVs"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAVw">[</span>27<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAV0">]</span></span></a></sup></li>
<li id="mwAV4"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Faisal_bin_Abdul_Majeed?action=edit&amp;redlink=1" title="Faisal bin Abdul Majeed (page does not exist)" class="new" typeof="mw:LocalizedAttrs" id="mwAV8" data-mw-i18n='{"title":{"lang":"x-page","key":"red-link-title","params":["Faisal bin Abdul Majeed"]}}'>Prince Faisal bin Abdul Majeed</a> (son of <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Abdul_Majeed_bin_Abdulaziz_Al_Saud" title="Abdul Majeed bin Abdulaziz Al Saud" id="mwAWA">Prince Abdul Majeed</a>)</li>
<li id="mwAWE"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Abdulaziz_bin_Hathloul?action=edit&amp;redlink=1" title="Abdulaziz bin Hathloul (page does not exist)" class="new" typeof="mw:LocalizedAttrs" id="mwAWI" data-mw-i18n='{"title":{"lang":"x-page","key":"red-link-title","params":["Abdulaziz bin Hathloul"]}}'>Prince Abdulaziz bin Hathloul</a> (son of <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hathloul_bin_Abdulaziz_Al_Saud" title="Hathloul bin Abdulaziz Al Saud" id="mwAWM">Prince Hathloul</a>)</li></ul>

<p id="mwAWQ"><b id="mwAWU">Great Grandsons of King Abdul-Aziz</b><sup about="#mwt117" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-members_26-3" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"members"}}'><a href="#cite_note-members-26" id="mwAWY"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAWc"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAWg">[</span>26<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAWk">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

<ul id="mwAWo"><li id="mwAWs"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fahd_bin_Faisal_bin_Turki?action=edit&amp;redlink=1" title="Fahd bin Faisal bin Turki (page does not exist)" class="new" typeof="mw:LocalizedAttrs" id="mwAWw" data-mw-i18n='{"title":{"lang":"x-page","key":"red-link-title","params":["Fahd bin Faisal bin Turki"]}}'>Prince Fahd bin Faisal bin Turki</a> (grandson of <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Turki_I_bin_Abdulaziz_Al_Saud" title="Turki I bin Abdulaziz Al Saud" id="mwAW0">Turki I of Nejd and Hejaz</a>)</li>
<li id="mwAW4"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Prince_Faisal?action=edit&amp;redlink=1" title="Prince Faisal (page does not exist)" class="new" typeof="mw:LocalizedAttrs" id="mwAW8" data-mw-i18n='{"title":{"lang":"x-page","key":"red-link-title","params":["Prince Faisal"]}}'>Prince Faisal</a> (grandson of <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Saud_of_Saudi_Arabia" title="Saud of Saudi Arabia" id="mwAXA">King Saud</a>)</li>
<li id="mwAXE"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Turki_bin_Mohammed_Al_Saud_(born_1979)" title="Turki bin Mohammed Al Saud (born 1979)" id="mwAXI">Prince Turki</a> (grandson of <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fahd_of_Saudi_Arabia" title="Fahd of Saudi Arabia" id="mwAXM">King Fahd</a>)</li></ul>

<p id="mwAXQ">In June 2017, 31 out of 34 members approved the selection of <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mohammed_bin_Salman" title="Mohammed bin Salman" id="mwAXU">Mohammad bin Salman</a> as Crown Prince.<sup about="#mwt120" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-28" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-28"}}'><a href="#cite_note-28" id="mwAXY"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAXc"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAXg">[</span>28<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAXk">]</span></span></a></sup> Three members who voted against his selection were <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ahmed_bin_Abdulaziz_Al_Saud" title="Ahmed bin Abdulaziz Al Saud" id="mwAXo">Ahmed bin Abdulaziz</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Muhammad_bin_Saad_Al_Saud" title="Muhammad bin Saad Al Saud" id="mwAXs">Muhammad bin Saad</a> and <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Abdulaziz_bin_Abdullah_Al_Saud" title="Abdulaziz bin Abdullah Al Saud" id="mwAXw">Abdulaziz bin Abdullah</a>.<sup about="#mwt123" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-sfp_29-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"sfp"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-sfp-29"}}'><a href="#cite_note-sfp-29" id="mwAX0"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAX4"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAX8">[</span>29<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAYA">]</span></span></a></sup> The latter represented his older brother, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Khalid_bin_Abdullah_Al_Saud_(born_1950)" title="Khalid bin Abdullah Al Saud (born 1950)" id="mwAYE">Khalid bin Abdullah</a>, at the meeting of the council.<sup about="#mwt124" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-sfp_29-1" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"sfp"}}'><a href="#cite_note-sfp-29" id="mwAYI"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAYM"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAYQ">[</span>29<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAYU">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

